{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39403","headline":"涂次逢李氏兄弟感旧 · 韦庄","name":"涂次逢李氏兄弟感旧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"御沟四面朱门宅，记得当时好弟兄。\n晓傍柳阴骑竹马，夜隈灯影弄先生。\n巡街趂蝶衣裳破，上屋探雏手脚轻。\n今日相逢俱老大，忧家忧国尽公卿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39403.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39403","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}